!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/link-orders-service.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/meta-service.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/core.tn"
@doc:"""
  A fixture schema for the class2/link layer, importing meta-service.tn: three record types and a namespace of two
  services, each a record holding its methods in its `methods` field, one also naming the other in its own
  `extends` field. A vector importing it binds a method through a service's field by a qualified name,
  `shop.orders.methods.place_order`: an entry, a key of it, a field of the record value there, and a key of the
  interface that field holds.
  """
!schema {
  order               => { sku: text  quantity: int32 }
  receipt             => { total: int64 }
  place_order_request => { order: order }
  shop => !services {
    reads  => { methods: { get_order => { response: order } } }
    orders => { extends: [reads]  methods: { place_order => { request: place_order_request  response: receipt } } }
  }
}
